B.HA=new A.br(B.avM,["Close","The city's look","Classic","The city as it is \xb7 free","Garden City","Glass towers with gardens on every step","Garden City look","Drag to compare","Today","Your city can do more","at home","areas","colours","People at home","Your own areas","City colours","in Family","Free","from {p} a month","See SkyTasks+","For you","For you, your home, or your team","Personal+","Family","Team","Yearly","Monthly","save {n}%","a year","a month","That is {p} a month","Up to 6 neighbourhoods of your own (3 free)","Colour sets for the whole city","Up to 6 people in one home","Everything in Personal+, for each of them","Kids mode, soon","Founder price for life, for the first 1,000 subscribers","What you had for free stays free","Join for {p} a year","Join for {p} a month","Restore purchase","Renews by itself. Cancel any time in {store} settings, up to 24 hours before it renews.","SkyTasks+ is bought on the phone, and then works here too.","The store did not answer. Try again in a moment.","Welcome to SkyTasks+","Team for businesses \xb7 soon","Up to 15 people, tasks from the manager and a team board. We will let you know when it opens.","Let me know","Noted. We will let you know.","Renews on {d}","Ends on {d}","Manage in the store","End the test plan","SkyTasks+","Garden City, colours, a bigger home and more neighbourhoods","Thanks for building with us","Active","A home of three or more is part of Family","More than 3 neighbourhoods of your own are part of SkyTasks+","City colours","Year","Month","Garden City and five colour sets for your city","Up to {n} neighbourhoods of your own","A home of up to {n}, one subscription for everyone","Everything you have today stays free","Your day arranges itself around your calendar","A video of your city, whenever you want it","Seasons, real weather and landmarks in your city","A focus timer that builds a tower, and reminders that won't let go","Your day, arranged every day","It is free once a week. With SkyTasks+ your open tasks find their place in the free hours every day, and you can change anything.","A reminder that won't let go","For what really matters: it comes back every few minutes until you mark it done or move it.","A focus timer that builds","Pick a time and work without distractions. Every 25 minutes add a floor to a tower in your city, and you see where your hours went.","Your city's video, whenever you want","One video a month is free, with our logo. With SkyTasks+ make one any time, for a week, a month or a year, without the logo and with your choice of music.","A city that lives through the year","Snow in winter, blossom in spring, leaves in autumn, and rain when it rains where you are. Every part has its own switch.","Landmarks for your city","Every 50 tasks you finish raise a special building that only SkyTasks+ cities have.","Arrange my day","{n} waiting for a time","Place {n}","No room today for {n}","There is no free time left today","Your day is arranged","Tap to change, hold to move","Time","How long","Take it out of the plan","Don't let go","Still open. Done, later or tomorrow?","Focus timer","Focus on this task",u.X,"Start","Finish","Floor {n} is going up","This week","{n} minutes, and a new floor. The tower has {f}.","{n} minutes went into the tower","{n} floors","Seasons and weather","Seasons in the city","Snow on the roofs in winter, blossom in spring, autumn colours.","Things in the air","Falling snow, petals and leaves.","Real weather","Rain or snow when it is happening in the city you choose.","Weather city","Choose","Weather data from MET Norway. Only the chosen city is sent.","Winter","Spring","Autumn","Rain","Landmarks","The next landmark","All six stand in your city","{n} more tasks","In your city","A new landmark in your city","The Suspension Bridge","The City Gate","The Clock Tower","The Lookout Dome","The Amphitheatre","The Great Statue","Your city's video","Video","My city","This week","This month","This year","tasks became a city","Morning","Street","Night","No music","Make and share","Share a picture of the city","Building your video\u2026","Share the video","Save to the phone","Saved to your videos","Could not save the video","The video could not be made. Try again.","Finish a few tasks in this time and your city will have a story to tell.","The video itself is made and shared in the app on your phone.","One video a month is free, with our logo.","This month's free video is made.","My city","My day","Calendar and display","People","Account and help","The city's look","{d} tasks done \xb7 level {l}","See what it adds","Free","See the prices","Maths lesson","Study for the exam","Team meeting","Hand in the project","The day arranges itself","One tap puts your tasks into the free time in your calendar. You can change any time it picked.","Once a week","Every day, as often as you like","A video of your city","Fifteen seconds of your city going up from the tasks you finished, ready to share.","One a month, with our logo","Any time, no logo, a week to a year, your music","A reminder that won't let go","For the task you can't miss: it keeps ringing until you mark it done or move it.","One reminder for each task","Rings again until it is handled","A focus timer that builds",u.X,"The timer in focus mode","A growing tower, and where your hours went","Seasons and real weather","Snow in winter, blossom in spring, and rain when it rains where you are. Each part can be turned off.","The same city all year","Four seasons and live weather","Landmarks","Every 50 tasks you finish raise a landmark in your city: a bridge, a clock tower, a dome and more.","Your neighbourhoods' buildings","Up to six landmarks, yours to keep","Garden City and colours","The same city with glass towers and gardens on every step, and sets of colours for every building.","The classic look","Garden City and every colour set","Room for more","More neighbourhoods of your own. With Family, a shared home for the whole household.","3 neighbourhoods, a home for 2","6 neighbourhoods; Family: a home for 6","Lots more to try","New in your city and your day:\n\u2022 A day that arranges itself around your calendar\n\u2022 A video of your city to share\n\u2022 Seasons and real weather in the city\n\u2022 A new landmark every 50 tasks\n\u2022 A focus timer that builds a tower\n\u2022 Reminders that keep going until it's done","Founder price \xb7 half, for good","Founder price \xb7 {n} places left","Not now","A third person at home, with Family","A home of two stays free. Family opens it up to six, and one subscription covers everyone.","A fourth neighbourhood with SkyTasks+","Three neighbourhoods of your own are free. With SkyTasks+ up to six, and Garden City and colours for the whole city.","Colour the city with SkyTasks+","Five colour sets for every building in your city, and the Garden City look too.","Your city as a Garden City","Glass towers with gardens on every step, and pale terraces with trees. Drag the line to compare.","Level 5! See it in the Garden City?","Your own city in glass, terraces and gardens. Drag the line to compare.","Take a look","Team for your office","Tasks, approvals, the team calendar and the office","Up to {n} people","Everyone in the team gets SkyTasks+","for the whole team","Start {n} days free","Continue for {p}","Free for {n} days, then it renews by itself. Cancel in {store} settings before the trial ends and nothing is charged.","Your team was here first: {n} more days free","The team is read only: everything stays, nothing new can be added","Half price for good, for teams that were here before","A manager of the team can renew Team.","Team is on. Everyone in the team has SkyTasks+.","The team is read only","Team has ended. Everything can be seen and marked done; a manager can renew it.","Team has ended. Everyone still sees everything and can mark it done. To add tasks, people and meetings again, renew it.","Renew Team","{n} days left of the free month","After that, half price for good, because your team was here first.","Choose Team","Team for the office","{n} days free","Read only","Start Team for the office","The team opens once a manager starts Team.","14 days free, then one price for the whole team. Until then, tasks, people and meetings wait.","The team is read only. A manager can renew Team.","SkyTasks+ is here","Everything you had for free stays free. SkyTasks+ adds Garden City and colour sets for your city and up to six neighbourhoods of your own; Family opens a home of up to six. The first 1,000 pay half, for good.","Your city as a Garden City","Glass towers with gardens on every step and pale terraces with trees, and they rise with every level. Settings \u2192 The city's look.","One set colours every building in the city. The grass, the roads and the people stay.","Classic","The city as it is \xb7 free","Mediterranean","White and blue","Jerusalem stone","Warm and quiet","Pastel","Soft and light","Violet","Deep, lovely in the evening","Colour the city","Colour the city with SkyTasks+","Task City","My city","Today","Tonight",'New task\u2026 e.g. "call the dentist"',"Add","Nothing open. Add a task and watch a floor appear.","done this week","windows lit","of","All","Later","Built today","Delete","Undo","Added: {t}","Added {n} tasks: {t}","Added by voice: {t}","Task deleted","Progress in ","quiet for 5 days","Day","Night","\u05e2\u05d1\u05e8\u05d9\u05ea","Sign in","Create account","Sign out","Email","Password","Show","Continue without an account","Save your city","Sign up or sign in to start: your city is kept safe, on every device.","I already have an account","New here? Create an account","That did not work. Check the email and password and try again.","Check your inbox to confirm the email, then sign in.","Forgot password","Check your email","We sent a 6-digit code to ","Confirm","Didn't get it? You can resend in ","Didn't get it? Send a new code","We sent a new code","Fix the email address","That code did not work, or it has expired. Try again or ask for a new one.","New password","Enter the code we sent to "," and choose a new password.","New password","At least 6 characters","Save and sign in","Back to sign in",'Type your email above, then tap "Forgot password" again.',"We could not send the email. Check the address and try again in a minute.","Saved to your account","Saved on this device only","today","tomorrow","When","No date","New task","Edit task","Neighbourhood","Project (a building)","No project","New project",'e.g. "Kitchen renovation"',"Pick a date","Repeat","Once","Every day","Every week","Every month","Reminder","None","Pick a time","Save","Details","Projects","Inbox","in the inbox","Morning plan","Good morning \xb7 one minute to plan","What goes into today?","Star up to 3 main tasks","Up to 3 main tasks a day","Let's go","for today","Evening summary","Built in the city today","steps","Still open","Tomorrow","Other date","All to tomorrow, good night","Postponed {n} times. Break it into a small first step?","Break it up","First step: ","Main tasks of the day","Morning","Afternoon","Evening","Any time","Got {n} tasks","Tap a detail to change it","Add {n} tasks","Cancel","Quick picks","Time","Note or link","Main task","Done","15 more min","Listening\u2026","Voice is not available here. Use the keyboard mic.","Nothing left open. Well done.","All your tasks,\nmade easy.","One place for everything you need to do, with reminders on time and a city that shows your progress.","Step {n} of 5","Who is the city for?","You can change this in settings any time.","Just me","My own city","Together, as a couple or a home","One city for two","With my team","A small team, up to 15 people","Family with kids","Coming soon","What will you call your city?","The name sits at the top of your home screen.","City name","My city","Taskville","Our home","What is the first thing you will finish?","Something small for today. It starts your first building.","Or write your own","Call the dentist","Study for the test","Maths homework","Make the slides for the meeting","Email the client","Buy milk","Pack my bag for tomorrow","Answer one message","Tidy the closet","A 20-minute run","Pay the electricity bill","Get started","Continue","Build my city","Today","Week","{day} is busy ({n}). Long-press a task and drop it on a lighter day.","Long-press a task to move it to another day","Nothing planned.","Weekly summary","This week the city grew {n} steps","Best day","Most done in","Plan next week","worth a visit","A quiet week. One small task tomorrow gets things moving.","City","Level","tasks to the next level","Top level","Progress","Week","Calendar","No time:","Moved to {t}","Google Calendar","Connecting\u2026","Synced with Google","Connected. Tasks with a time now appear in the SkyTasks calendar in Google.","Could not connect to Google Calendar. Try again in a moment.","Google sync failed","All day","(no title)","My calendars","Not connected","Your classes and meetings, right here","SkyTasks reads the calendars already on your phone and adds your tasks with a time to them. It all stays on the phone.","Connect my calendars","Not now","The phone did not allow calendar access. You can allow it in the phone settings, under SkyTasks.","What shows in the calendar","All your calendars are ticked, except SkyTasks: your tasks already show.","Done","No calendars found on this phone.","On this phone","Where tasks with a time go","Moved or renamed there, the task follows. Deleted there, the task stays, without a time.","{n} calendars","1 calendar","Show my phone's calendars","Events from the calendars on your phone (Google, iCloud, Outlook) show beside your tasks, and tasks with a time go into the calendar you pick. Nothing from your calendar is saved on our server.","Export my tasks","A file with all your tasks: name, date, time, neighborhood and what is done. It is made on this device, and you save or send it from there.","Table (CSV)","Opens in Excel and Google Sheets","Export a table","Calendar file (.ics)","Goes into any calendar: Google, Apple, Outlook","Export to a calendar","Include tasks that are done","{n} tasks","No tasks to export yet.","Could not make the file. Try again in a moment.","Task","Date","Time","Neighborhood","Project","Done","Repeats","Note","Yes","Created in SkyTasks","Sent {n} tasks with a time to the SkyTasks calendar in Google.","tasks done in the last 7 days","Most active:","The days ahead","Nothing planned","Tasks","Profile","Lot","Foundations","Under construction","Finished","Full of life","Office tower","House","Playground","Clinic","School","Bank","Supermarket","Family house","All tasks","New task here\u2026","What needs doing?","open","done","this week","Evening look","Account","Tap a building to see its tasks","No tasks here yet. Add the first one.","Work","Home","Family","Health","Study","Money","Settings","Reminder before a task","On time","Off","Minutes before. A task without a time gets no reminder.","Daily habits","Morning plan","Evening summary","Weekly summary, Saturday night","Weekly summary, Sunday","Tap a time to change it. A switched-off screen still opens from the Tasks tab.","Language and display","Day and night","Automatic","Always day","Always night","The week starts on","Sunday","Monday","Who lives in the city","A real shared home is coming soon. For now this is only saved.","Edit","City name","Privacy policy","Terms of use","By creating or opening an account you accept the |terms of use| and the |privacy policy|.","Report a bug","Check for a new version","Your version: {v}","You have the latest version.","Loading the new version\u2026","A new version of the app is out.","Refresh","Could not check right now. Try again in a moment.","Versions to try","The main version","You are in a test version: {v}","Report a bug","What happened? What did you expect to happen?","Sent straight to the SkyTasks team, with the app version and device type. Your tasks are not sent.","Send","Thanks! The report was sent.","Could not send. Check the connection and try again.","Not signed in \xb7 this phone only","Delete account and city","Delete the city","Delete the city?","Your account, {n} tasks{p} and every building will be deleted from the server and from this phone. They cannot be restored.","{n} tasks{p} and every building will be deleted from this phone. They cannot be restored.","To confirm, type {w}","DELETE",", {n} projects","Delete forever","Could not delete. Check the connection and try again.","Time to plan the day","Pick what goes into today.","How did today go?","Close the day and move what is left.","Your week in the city","See what you built this week.","now","in {n} min","at {t}","Your city is waiting for you","Everything is where you left it. {n} tasks are waiting, and one small one is enough to come back.","Everything is where you left it. One task is waiting.","Everything is where you left it. What is next?","Nothing set for today","What goes into today? Tap to plan.","Today: one task","Today: {n} tasks","First at {t}: {title}","Top of the list: {title}","Day closed","Next","Nothing left today. Good night, city.","{n} of {n} done. Tap to see the city at night.","{d} of {n} done. {left}","One is waiting for a decision.","{n} are waiting for a decision.","{n} tasks done this week.","Still open. Mark it done or move it?","{b} is now level {n}","{n} tasks done \xb7 {d}","First task \xb7 {d}","{p}: building finished","{n} tasks","{n} of {n} tasks","The office tower","The house","The playground","The clinic","The school","The bank","The supermarket","The family house","The shop","The studio","The garden","The tower","More notifications","A task whose time passed","Your city is quiet","Notifications are off","SkyTasks sends nothing to your phone until you allow it. The app itself keeps working.","Turn on notifications","An hour after a task that is still open, and after 3 days away. At most 3 a day with the morning and evening ones; task reminders always ring.","Pick up Noa from practice","What's new","Version {n}","{a} of {b}","Next","To the city","Skip","Dentist","A living city, and you in it",'Between the buildings there are now roads with traffic lights, a bus that stops at its stop and people crossing at the zebra. And there is you: the figure in the yellow cap stands by your next task, and after "Done" walks to the one after.',"One home for two",'Invite your partner with a WhatsApp link. Each of you keeps your own city, and one neighbourhood is shared: "Our home", with a window in each person\'s colour. When a task is given to you, you get a notification. You both need an account.',"Reminders and celebrations","Each morning, what waits today, and an hour after a task that is still open, one nudge. When the day is done, a small bar slides down and the building glows. Every kind can be turned off in Settings.","Events in the calendar",'In the calendar tab, press and hold an hour and drag: an event with a start and an end. A sentence like "Meeting tomorrow 10 to 11" becomes one too. Events go to Google Calendar, and they are not tasks: nothing to tick, nothing built.',"Lunch with Dan","Work","Share your city",'A postcard of your city with what you built, or a night story with the lit windows. From settings, and at the big moments. And "Invite a friend" sends a ready message.',"Share","Done \xb7 {n}","Show all {n}","All done here","{k} more and level {n}","Story","Share my city","A picture with a link","Invite a friend","A ready message","Level {n}","Finished projects","tasks that became a city.","{c}, level {n}.","Tasks and calendar that build you a city","This is the city I built in SkyTasks from my own tasks: every task I finish adds to it, and the calendar and reminders keep my day in order. Want to try? {link}","SkyTasks runs my tasks, calendar and studies, and every task I finish builds my city. I think you'd like it: {link}","Could not share. Please try again.","Due today","Due tomorrow","Due {d}","{n} days left","Past the deadline","Deadline","None","No deadline","Deadline: {t}","Deadline tomorrow: {t}","Deadline today: {t}","Still open. A few minutes now and it is off your head.",'The last day to finish it. Until then it shows every day under To do today, with a reminder the evening before and on the morning itself. You can also write "by Monday" in the sentence.',"Deadline",'Write "by Monday", and the task shows every day until then, with the days left and a reminder before.',"tidy the closet by Monday","Invite a friend","Invite more","The message and its link are copied too, to paste if needed","Want to see the city I built out of my tasks? \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f It is SkyTasks: tasks, calendar and studies in one place, and every task you finish builds a little more. Join me, a pool is waiting in your city: {link}","A prize for every friend","Every friend who joins through your link and finishes a first task opens a special building in your city. Their city starts with a pool too.","Next","Joined, no first task yet: {n}","I have a code from a friend","The six letters and numbers from the link, or the whole link.","Done","That code does not match anyone.","This is your own code.","A friend is already linked to this account.","Codes work in the first two weeks of a new account.","A friend joined your city!","A gift from the friend who invited you","New in your city: {b}","Pool, Ferris wheel and more","{n} of 5 built","Pool","Ferris wheel","Stadium","Carousel","Lighthouse","Share with the class","Who else has the {s} exam on {d}? \ud83d\udcda I added it to SkyTasks with a countdown and study times, and you can add it too in one tap: {link}","A classmate shared this exam. Add it to your calendar, with a countdown and study times?","Add","Haifa","Buildings now reach level 10","After level 5 every building keeps growing: more floors, a balcony, solar panels. At level 9 a green roof and a lit sign, and at level 10 a flag and a plaza.","Tap the city and fly there","Tap a building to open its tasks, or a neighbourhood to fly the camera to it. Turning with two fingers now goes the right way too.","Copy to another day, and where it is",'On a task or an event: "Copy to another day". An event can have a place, shown small under its hours. And you pick a time with a wheel now.',"Your day on the home screen","Five new widgets: today, what is next, your city, progress and quick add. Tick a task without opening the app. To add one, press and hold the home screen and choose Widgets.","Pay the electric bill","Buy milk","Pick up Noa","Call grandma","A new tasks tab",'On top, the next three hours, the first one with "Done". Below it, what has no set time, by neighbourhood. Swipe right to finish a task and left to move it to tomorrow. Meetings stay in the calendar.',"Your calendars, right here","Classes, shifts and meetings from the calendars on your phone (Google, iCloud, Outlook) show in the calendar tab, and a task with a time goes into your calendar too. Move or rename a meeting right here, pick a calendar for each task, event, lesson or exam, and your timetable goes into the calendar as weekly lessons. Connect them in the calendar tab.","Something is on in the city","Every few days there is a market or a festival in the city, and on holidays a hanukkiah in the square. Tap it, and everyone heads there.","Focus mode","Walk into your city","Two fingers turn the city and tilt it down to the street; pinch to come close. Tap a building to fly to it, double-tap to land by its door. Up close: curtains, faces, and your next task on a sign over the door.","Three ways to lay out your city","The grid, a square with a fountain, or the old city with a plaza and gates. The same city, buildings and tasks; only the layout changes. Settings \u2192 My neighbourhoods.",'One task on the screen with a small first step, a timer that builds a building while you work, and reading aloud. "Too hard" gives an even smaller step. Turn it on in Settings, under Focus.',"The city speaks",'Reminders come from the building of your neighbourhood: "From the clinic: dentist". And there are small sounds when you finish a task or tap the city. Turn them off in settings; on silent they stay quiet.',"That email address does not look right. Check it has an @ and a dot.","Did you mean ","Check the email address: the code goes there. Tap again to use it as it is.","The password is too short. Use at least 6 characters.","Wrong email or password. If you signed up with Google, use the Google button.","This email already has an account. Enter its password to sign in.","Too many tries. Wait a minute and try again.","No internet connection. Check it and try again.","Google sign-in did not work. Try again, or use your email.","or","Continue with Google","Continue with Apple","Skip","{n} of {m}","Build my city","Your timetable and exams","Fill in your timetable once: lessons come back every week and skip the holidays. An exam gets a countdown and study sessions in your free hours, and each one builds a floor of your school.","Maths exam \xb7 6 days to go","Floor 1 of 3","Write it the way you say it","One sentence, and the task finds its place in your city: the day, the time and the neighbourhood fill in by themselves. You can also just say it.","Dentist tomorrow at 10","Health \xb7 tomorrow 10:00","Every task builds your city","Each part of your life has a neighbourhood and a building. A finished task takes it up a level, and at night the windows light up. Two fingers turn the city and take you down to its streets.","The office, level 3","Reminded right on time","A reminder comes before each task, and you can tick it done or push it right from there. A short plan in the morning, a look back in the evening.","Dentist","In 15 min \xb7 10:00","One calendar for everything",'Classes and meetings from the calendars on your phone show by day, 3 days, week or month, and a task drops into a free hour. Invite your partner to a shared neighbourhood, "Our home".',"Calendar \xb7 Lecture 10:00 \xb7 Free 2:30","Noa added: buy milk","Feature guide","See the tour again","5 pages, about a minute","A task or an event?","Task: something to do",'You tick it "done", and it builds your city. It can have a time, or just a day, or neither. In the calendar it takes half an hour unless you give it a length.',"Event: time that is taken",'A lecture, a meeting, a party: a start and an end in the calendar. Nothing to tick and it does not build, it only keeps the hours. Drag over the hours in the calendar, or write a range: "meeting 10 to 11".',"The basics","More you can do","Try it","Add with a sentence or your voice",'"Dentist tomorrow at 10", and it is set.',"A city that grows","Every finished task takes a building up a level.","Reminders and daily habits","A reminder before each task, a morning plan and an evening look back.","Calendar and events","Day, 3 days, week or month, with your phone's calendars; drag a task to a free hour, or over the hours for an event.","Our home","A shared neighbourhood for couples or a home, with a WhatsApp invite, and one calendar for the whole home with a column each.","A team","A small team, up to 15: tasks for each, a team calendar, events and an office. Open one in two minutes.","A prize for every friend","Every friend who joins through your link and finishes a first task builds a special place in your city: a pool, a Ferris wheel, a stadium, a carousel and a lighthouse. Their city starts with a pool too. And an exam can now be shared with your class.","Invite a friend","Every friend who joins through your link builds a pool, a Ferris wheel and more in your city. An exam can be shared with the class.","One calendar for the whole home",'An event can be the home\'s: for everyone, or for whoever you tick. In the calendar, "Our home" shows a column for each of you. Everyone can change it, and the others get a notification.',"A deadline for a task",'Write "by Monday", and the task shows every day until then, with the days left and a reminder the evening before.',"tidy the closet by Monday","A glass tower in the heart of your city","Your city has a new heart:\n\u2022 A glass tower in the middle, a floor for every area of your life\n\u2022 Seven windows on each floor, one for every day of the week\n\u2022 Every task you finish lights its day's window with a golden cube\n\u2022 In the evening the whole tower lights up\n\u2022 Tap a floor to see its week","Your calendar, redesigned","Your calendar looks completely different:\n\u2022 A clean, calm design with no extra lines\n\u2022 What's next stands out in blue, the past fades\n\u2022 Two things at once sit one over the other\n\u2022 Swipe sideways to the next day\n\u2022 Day, 3 days, week and month in one style","Your calendar, private",'In a shared home, you choose what the home sees of you:\n\u2022 Only what belongs to the home\n\u2022 Or "busy" too, with no details\n\u2022 Or no column of yours at all\n\u2022 An event for some of you is seen only by them',"Adding, lighter","Adding a task, faster:\n\u2022 The + opens into a card over the keyboard\n\u2022 Write one line and send it with the arrow\n\u2022 What we understood shows as tags you can change","Maths","Physics revision","Basketball","Next","revise physics tomorrow at 4pm","Tomorrow","Studies","Tidy the closet","Send the form","Hand in the paper","A team, for small teams","Open a team in two minutes and send the link on WhatsApp, Telegram or by mail. Tasks for each person, approvals, a team calendar, events at a time everyone is free, and an office where you see who is working. Up to 15 people, free.","Mine, the home and the team",'One switch over the calendar and the tasks. "Mine" has everything that is yours, from every place, and the + adds where you are looking. You can let the home see when you are busy at work, hours only.',"Dana, Avi, Yossi, Michal, Ron","Studio","Dani, Noa, Ori","Dentist","Football","Friday dinner","Team meeting","Repeating tasks and projects",'"Every Tuesday", and projects that rise as buildings of their own.',"every Tuesday ","The week, and moving tasks","Press and hold a task, then drag it to another day.","Neighbourhoods of your own","Up to 3, with your own name, building and words.","Widgets and sharing","Your tasks on the home screen, and WhatsApp text that becomes a task.","Press and hold an empty spot on your home screen, tap Widgets and pick SkyTasks. To share, select text in WhatsApp, tap Share, then SkyTasks.","This week","Next week","Earlier week","Later week","Widgets and sharing","Today and what is next on the home screen, your progress on the Lock Screen, and WhatsApp text that becomes a task.","Press and hold an empty spot on your home screen, tap Edit, then Add Widget, and pick SkyTasks. For the Lock Screen, press and hold it, tap Customize, then the space under the clock. Widgets need iOS 17 or later. To share, select text in WhatsApp or Mail, tap Share, then SkyTasks.","Your day on the home screen, now on iPhone","New widgets: today's tasks and what is next, and on the Lock Screen, what is next and your progress. Tap a circle to mark a task done without opening the app. To add one, press and hold the home screen, then tap Edit.","Got it","Task","Event","e.g. Meeting with the accountant","Save to calendar","Add task","Delete","Where (optional)","Whose is the event?","Just me","The home's","Who is in it?","The whole home","Me","{names} will get a notice when it is saved.","Only whoever made the event can take it out of the home.","Mine","Our home","Nothing on this day for anyone","The whole home","Copy to another day","Copied to {d}","Reminder {n} min before","Reminder when it starts","No reminder","Apple sign-in did not work. Try again, or use your email.","New account","I have one","Connect Google Calendar too?","Tasks with a time go to a separate calendar called SkyTasks, and come back here if you move them there. Your other calendars stay untouched.","Connect the calendar","Not now","Signed in as {e}","tasks done","days you built","Waiting for you","Focus","Focus mode","One task on the screen, a 2-minute first step, a timer that builds, and reading aloud.","Large, roomy text","Every text in the app gets bigger.","On","Off","Now","First step","Step {a} of {b}","A smaller step","{n} min","Done, next step","Done","Too hard, a smaller step","The whole task is done","Tap to start","{t} left","Paused \xb7 {t}","Time is up. Another round, or done.","{n} more today","Hide the rest of today","Read aloud","There is no English voice on this phone. You can add one in the phone settings, under text-to-speech.","What should the city help you with?","Pick as many as you like.","Studies and exams","Work and projects","Home and family","Focus, attention and getting organised","Just running my day","One task on the screen, a 2-minute first step, a timer that builds a building, and reading aloud. You can turn it off in settings.","city level","Your city is only on this phone","New phone? It would be gone. Saving it takes a second.","Save","Reminders","{n} min before","Account","Help and bug reports","Google Calendar","Connected","Not connected","Tasks with a time appear in a calendar called SkyTasks in your Google Calendar, and changes there come back here.","Sync now","Disconnect","Off","This is how it will look","Not signed in","An account keeps your city safe and on every device.","Got it:","When","Time","Repeats","Area","Main","Weekend","Next week","Other\u2026","Which neighbourhood?","Pick a date\u2026","Project","Steps","Add a step","Saved as you go","Filter","{a} of {b}","{a} of {b} done","The next hours","All in the calendar","To do today","No set time \xb7 whenever suits you","Past its time","Later","Done today {n}","One more and level {n}","{b} \xb7 level {n}","Today is free","Still waiting without a date:","Tap one to move it to today","{a} of {b}. Every window is lit.","Tomorrow: {n} tasks, the first at {t}","Tomorrow: {n} tasks","Done","See","City sounds","Free camera in the city","Two fingers turn the city and tilt it down to the street. Off: pan and zoom only, as before.","City style","Neighbourhoods","The same city, buildings and tasks. Only the layout changes.","Grid","Two crossing roads","Square","A fountain in the middle","Old city","A plaza with gates","Choose this style","That's your city's style","Back","Top view","Tower","City","Today","Day {d}","{n} tasks done \xb7 floor {f}","Nothing finished yet \xb7 the floor is being built","Still to do today","{n} more weeks","{n} tasks this week","Floor {f} \xb7 this week","Built: {b} in {d}","What gets built here, in order","now","Add to the list","Take off the list","Back to the usual list","Planning the city","{n} places in the city","{n} places \xb7 {l} more for {b}","Tap a free place to move it there","Coming here: ","Plan","Your finished tasks build the city","Your city grew: {n} new places","Built from everything you have already done","Neighbourhood \xb7 {n} places","{h} of {c} points","{n} more for {b}","{n} pts","Every task you finish here is a point. The points build the next place on the list by themselves.","Nothing done here this week yet","Street","Rate us","Short, soft sounds when a task is done, a building grows or you tap the city. Silent when your phone is.","Market day in the square","Stalls in the square, and everyone is on the way","A festival at the playground","Balloons, music, and the whole neighbourhood comes","Rain over the city","Umbrellas out. The square stays busy","Hanukkah in the square","One more candle tonight","Purim in the city","Costumes and balloons in the streets","Passover in the city","Spring, and a festive table in every home","Happy new year from the city","A sweet year to every neighbourhood","Sukkot in the city","Stalls in the square and guests in every sukkah","Good morning. Two minutes to plan the day?","How did today go? Close the day","Your week in the city is ready","Later on","Now","Next","Moved {n} times","Moved once","Done \u2713","+15 min","Shopping","My neighbourhoods","A hidden neighbourhood is not offered when you add a task, and the city shows a park in its place. Its tasks stay, and you can bring it back any time.","A neighbourhood of your own","Your neighbourhood","What is it called?","The dog, the business, the garden\u2026","Which building?","Colour","Words that send tasks here (optional)","A word, then Enter","It goes up in the new quarter, plot {n} of 3, and grows a level with every task you finish.","Create the neighbourhood","Delete the neighbourhood","Delete {name}?","{n} tasks move to Home. No task is deleted.","Shop","Studio","Garden","Tower","Add a neighbourhood of your own","Your own neighbourhoods","Up to 3 of your own","They stand in a new quarter across a new road, which opens with the first one.","New","Daily plan and summary","Our home","Busy \xb7 work","Show the home when I am busy at work",'The home sees only "busy \xb7 work" at those hours, from your team\'s events. Not what it is.',"Busy","What the home sees of me","The details of your personal schedule are never shown. Here you choose how much appears in the home's calendar.","Home items only","Only what belongs to the home","Home events and tasks appear in my column. My personal schedule does not.","Also busy","Also show when I am busy",'The home sees "Busy" at the hours of my events, phone calendars, classes, exams and tasks, with no title or place. These hours are saved on the server.',"Hidden","Hide my column","My column leaves the home's calendar. Events for the whole home stay, people in an event still see it, and home tasks stay on the list.","Only the people in it, and whoever made it, will see it.","The {name} family","Invite someone",'Invite your partner. "Our home" and its supermarket are shared; the rest of your city stays yours.',"A shared home needs an account, so both phones see the same tasks.","Family name (optional)","Levi","It hangs on a sign over the gate.","Living here","you","Someone else","Invite on WhatsApp","Copy the invite","Invite copied","Or a code to type in, good for 24 hours","I have a code","6 digits","Join","An invite from {name} to a shared home","An invite to a shared home",'Shared: "our home" and its shopping list.',"Yours alone: work, health and the rest of your city.","A notification comes when a task is given to you.","Sign in to join",'You live together now: "our home" stands in the new quarter.',"My name here","Leave the shared home","The home and its tasks stay with the others. What was yours to do goes to your own home neighbourhood.","Leave","That code is wrong or no longer valid. Ask for a new one.","Too many tries. Try again in an hour.","This home is full: up to 6 people.","A home of three or more is part of Family in SkyTasks+.","You already live in a shared home. Leave it first, in settings.","Something went wrong. Check the connection and try again.","An invite from {name} to our shared home in SkyTasks \ud83c\udfe1\n{link}\nOr type the code {code} in Settings \u203a Our home.","Shared home","For","Whoever gets to it","Me","Done by {name}","Back","Timetable","Timetable settings","Kind","School, by period","University, by hour","until {d}","Tap a cell to add a lesson. Lessons repeat every week until the end of the year, and skip the holidays by themselves.","Holidays are skipped by themselves. Other breaks: the sliders icon above. A tap on a lesson in the calendar can cancel it for one day.","Free","New lesson","Change the lesson","period {n}","Subject, e.g. Maths","Room (optional)","Lecture","Practice","Lab","Seminar","Add lesson","A name for the board: 11th grade 3, semester A\u2026","School days","Sun\u2013Thu","Sun\u2013Fri","Mon\u2013Fri","From when until when","Bell times","Add a period","Breaks by hand","Holidays are already skipped. Add anything else: a trip, a strike, your own semester break.","Break","Name (optional)","Add dates","Not set up","{n} lessons","Exams","Exam","No exams ahead. Add one, and the app proposes when to study for it.","days","{s} exam","{d} of {n} study sessions","This exam is gone.","Change the exam","Done","Today!","1 day to go","{n} days to go","Floor {d} of {n}","What to study","The chapters, the pages, what the teacher said\u2026","Delete the exam","The exam goes from the calendar. Its building and the study sessions stay in the city.","Subject, e.g. Maths","until","Add exam","Proposed study sessions","Study sessions","{n} proposed","The days before the exam are full. Add a study session by hand, or move something.","No study sessions.","Put it in the calendar","Put all {n} in the calendar","I will pick the hours myself","Add a study session","Study for the {s} exam","Session {k} of {n}","Built","Planned","Study session","Proposed","{n} min","How long","Day","3 days","Week","Month","{w}: no lessons","Hold and drop on an hour","No lesson today","To the timetable","Free","Free for {t}","Next","Now","View","Open the day","Exam","Break","Holiday","Nothing on this day yet.","Calendar","Default calendar","Another calendar\u2026","Which calendar?","Main","Meeting","From the calendar {c}","Save to the phone's calendar","Add a task from this","The phone did not let the change through. Try again, or change it in the calendar app.","Exam","Rosh Hashanah","Yom Kippur","Sukkot","Hanukkah","Purim","Passover","Independence Day","Lag BaOmer","Shavuot","Calendars by link","Paste an iCal address from Google Calendar, Outlook, Moodle or your school, and its events show here, read only, on every device.","Add a calendar by link",'Google Calendar: Settings \u2192 the calendar \u2192 "Secret address in iCal format". Outlook: Settings \u2192 Shared calendars \u2192 Publish. Moodle: the calendar export. Paste the address here. It stays on this device.',"Name (optional)","Add","That is not a calendar link. It should start with https:// or webcal://.","Added. Its events show in the calendar.","Could not read this calendar. Check the link, and that you are signed in.","Calendars by link need an account: sign in first.","Remove this calendar?","Timetable and exams","Your lessons on a board, repeating every week and skipping the holidays. An exam gets a countdown and study sessions in your free hours, and you can share it with your class.","Focus mode","One task, a small first step and a timer, when it is hard to start.","Walk into your city","Turn the city, tilt down to the street and come close.","City style","The grid, a square or the old city: the same city, laid out another way.",'Two fingers turn it and zoom. Drag up or down to tilt. Tap a building to fly to it, or tap twice on the ground to drop to the street. "Up" takes you back.',"A task by voice, without opening the app","A SkyTasks button on the Lock Screen, in Control Centre or on the Action button.",'Lock Screen: press and hold it, tap Customise, tap a button in a bottom corner and pick SkyTasks, "Task by voice". Control Centre: swipe down, press and hold, Add a Control, SkyTasks. Action button: Settings, Action Button, Controls, SkyTasks. Tap it, say the task, and it is in. Needs iOS 18; allow the microphone in the app once.',"Colour","Voice","The area's","Own","Last week","Delete the meeting?",'"{t}" will be deleted from your calendar on the phone, and from every device it syncs to.',"A calendar you shape with a finger","Hold a task without a time and drop it on a free hour. Drag a task to another hour or day, and pull its foot to make it longer. Give any task or event a colour of its own; whatever overlaps sits side by side, and the arrows go back to earlier weeks too. Calendars by link (Google, Outlook, Moodle, your school) show on every device, and Settings, under Account, exports everything as a table or a calendar file.","A calendar on your home screen","The new Calendar widget shows today by the hour: your meetings, events and tasks side by side, a line for now, and a circle to tick a task done. Press and hold the home screen, tap Widgets, and pick SkyTasks.","A task by voice, from the lock screen","Tap the SkyTasks button on the lock screen, in Control Centre or on the Action button, say the task, and it is in, with its day and time, without opening the app. Add the button: press and hold the lock screen, Customise, and pick SkyTasks.","Added: study for the exam \xb7 Thursday \xb7 16:00","Timetable, exams, and the week at a glance","Fill in your timetable once: lessons repeat every week and skip the holidays by themselves. Add an exam and the app proposes when to study in your free hours; every session is a floor of its building. The calendar now shows a day, 3 days with the free gaps, the week or the month, and tasks can be dragged into the gaps.","How a team works","Open it and invite","One link on WhatsApp or anywhere else. Up to 15 people.","A task for each person","Or for whoever gets to it first. It goes into their day and their calendar, with a reminder on time.","A team calendar","Events and meetings for everyone, and when you are all free.","The office","Who is at work and what moved forward, with a goal for the week.","What is yours stays yours","Managers see the team's tasks only, never your city, your own tasks or your calendar.","First steps \xb7 {n} of {m}","Hide","Open the team","Invite the team","Give a first task","Set a team event","A repeating task","Send","Give","Set","Set up","Invite","A task","An event","Repeating","Welcome to {team}","Your tasks from the team","They show here and in your calendar. Done updates everyone.",'"Me now"',"In the city tab, over the office: at work, on a break, sick or on holiday.","What is yours stays yours","The team sees the team's tasks only.","Got it","Your desk","Team","Open or join","A team is a shared office: everyone has a desk, managers give tasks and see progress. Your own city, tasks and calendar stay yours alone.","A team needs an account. Sign in and come back here.","I have a joining code","8 digits","Join","Open a team","The opening code from the email","Business name","Kind of business","High-tech and software","Office","Accounting","Law office","Marketing and advertising","Real estate","Insurance and finance","Design and architecture","Renovation","Construction","Electrics and plumbing","Cleaning","Delivery and moving","Garage","Salon","Clinic","Fitness studio","Restaurant or caf\xe9","Catering and events","Shop","Online shop","Education and tutoring","Kindergarten","Nonprofit","Farm","Other","No code? Ask to open a team","You were invited to {team}","Join the team","You asked to join {team}. A manager lets you in, and then the team's tasks show here.","Cancel the request","In the team","Waiting to be let in","Let in","No","Manager","Make a manager","No longer a manager","Take out of the team","{name} loses access to the team at once. The tasks stay in the team.","Invite to the team","Invite on WhatsApp","Send an invite","New code","The code and link you sent stop working, and whoever already joined stays. Make a new code?","People and managers","Tap someone to make them a manager or take them out.","{n} people","you manage it","{n} waiting to be let in","ME IN THE TEAM","THE WORK","MANAGING","Copy the invite","Joining code, for 7 days","Whoever joins with the link or the code is in at once. The code stays until you make a new one.","{team} on SkyTasks: the team's tasks are here. To join: {link}\nor the code {code} in Settings > Team.","The invite is copied","Emails that join by themselves","Addresses, separated by commas","Add","Whoever signs in with one of these emails is offered to join, with no wait.","Email them an invite","Added: {n}","My name in the team","Team name","Kind of business","What kind of business?","The team's goal for the week","{n} tasks","What managers did","Nothing yet","Team opened","New joining code","Asked to join","Let in","Joined by email","Left","Taken out","Made a manager","No longer a manager","Email added","Email removed","Task approved","Task sent back","Task given","Task deleted","Team settings","Export the team's tasks","Delete the team","Every team task is deleted from the server, for the whole team. This cannot be undone.","Delete","Leave the team","The team's tasks leave your phone and your calendar. They stay in the team.","Leave","The code is wrong, or it has expired","Too many tries. Try again in an hour.","You opened two teams this month. Write to us to open another.","Confirm your email first, then open the team.","You're in {team}","Up to 15 people. Open it now, then invite the team on WhatsApp.","The team is full (15 people)","You already have a team","Only managers can do that","At least one manager has to stay","The team needs a name","Something went wrong. Try again.","Request sent. A manager will let you in soon.","Join {team}","Join the team","The team's tasks come into your day and your calendar, with a tag.","Your own city, tasks and calendar stay yours. Managers see team tasks only.","A manager lets you in.","Sign in and join","Sent back to fix","Approve when done","For","Whoever gets to it","All","Mine","Team","My city","Team board","Waiting for your approval \xb7 {n}","Approve","Send back","What needs fixing?","The team today \xb7 {done} of {all}","Team goal this week","Desk of the week","From 3 tasks a week","{n} on time this week","{n} late","A task for the team","A task for {name}","done {t}","The team closed the week","Back from a manager: {note}","Waiting for approval","Approved","The team's week","{n} tasks done","{n} late","{n} waiting for approval","Office screen","The team city on a TV or a tablet in the office, with today's numbers.","Close","{n} tasks are waiting for your approval since yesterday","Waiting to be let in","Recurring tasks","Tasks that come back by themselves on the days you choose: opening, a weekly meeting, closing the till.","A recurring task","Task name","Time","Which days","Every day","Steps (optional), one per line","Ideas for {kind}","None yet.","Stop this recurring task","Its open copies are removed. What was done stays.","No time","Save","A name and at least one day","Mon","Tue","Wed","Thu","Fri","Sat","Sun","Team meetings","A meeting the whole team has every week. It goes into everyone\u2019s phone calendar, with the link.","A team meeting","Change the meeting","Meeting name","Weekly team meeting","Which day","How long","Link to the call (optional)","The link must start with https://","Join","Every","No team tasks for you today.","Me now:","At work","On a break","Done for today","At work now","Around the office","Not in the office","Active today","Today","Late","On time this week","Waiting for approval","Done today","To do","Manager","Team","Zoom in","Zoom out","Turn the room","The whole room","Sick","Holiday","Sick today","On holiday today","Give today\u2019s open tasks back to the team, so someone else can take them?","Give them back","Keep them","{n} tasks went back to the team","Stuck? Ask the team for help","You asked for help. A manager will hand it on.","Asked for help","Needs someone \xb7 {n}","asked for help","nobody has it","Give to","Comments","Write a comment\u2026","Send","No comments yet.","{late} late \xb7 {waits} waiting for approval \xb7 {help} need someone","Asked for help","Gave tasks back","Everyone free","Find a time","Show the team when I am busy","Only the hours from the calendars on this phone, never names or details. Off at any time.","Busy","Team meeting","Team task",'Tap a name for their tasks. Tap "everyone free" to set a meeting then.',"Today","Swipe for more","An event for the team","An event or a meeting: what is it","Pick a day and hour","Picked by you","Event","With whom","How long","Half an hour","An hour","Two hours","An hour and a half","{n} min","{n} hours","Today","Tomorrow","This week","Next week","Two weeks","Work hours","Morning","Noon","Afternoon","Evening","When","This week","Next week","When everyone is free","Everyone is free","All but {name}","No time when everyone is free. Try another week, or less time.",'Times from everyone\u2019s "busy", without seeing what it is. Work hours: Sunday to Thursday, 08:00\u201318:00.',"Add it to the calendar","Added, everyone sees it","Pick at least one more person","Today \xb7 a line for each person, tap to open","{done} of {all}","Not today","Whoever gets to it","Their full card","Thanks","Great work","You saved us","From the manager: {what}","Say thanks","{day} {date} \xb7 {from}\u2013{to}","In the code","Copy the code","Copy a branch name","Copied: {text}","Write {code} in a branch name or a pull request, and it links here. Merged, the task is done by itself.","In progress","Open","Merged","Closed","Checks","Passing","Failing","Running","Review","Approved","Changes asked","waiting","Open in GitHub","Connected \xb7 {account}","Not connected","SkyTasks reads issues and pull requests only. It never reads code and writes nothing to GitHub. A new issue becomes a team task; a pull request with a task\u2019s code marks it in progress, and merged, done.","Connect GitHub","Disconnect","New issues and pull requests will stop coming in. What is already linked stays.","A manager connects GitHub for the team.","Repositories","Task codes","Every team task has a code like {code}. A branch like {branch}, or the code in a pull request\u2019s title, links them.","Change the letters","1 to 5 English letters","Who is who on GitHub","Add mine","Not set","My GitHub name","Letters, numbers and - only","GitHub","The week in code","{merged} pull requests merged \xb7 {closed} tasks closed by themselves \xb7 {issues} new issues","Open more than 3 days","Waiting for a review","Issues nobody has"],t.li)
